---
layout: base.njk
lang: en
bodyClass: doc
title: "Skills"
description: "The installable skill package catalog of the Azhou AI Hub, generated from each package's SKILL.md frontmatter at build time."
permalink: "skills/index.html"
---

<div class="doc-grid">
  <nav class="doc-nav" aria-label="Skill packages">
    <p class="dn-group">Catalog</p>
    <ul class="dn-list">
      {%- for skill in skills %}
      <li><a href="#{{ skill.name }}">{{ skill.name }}</a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="dn-note"><a href="https://github.com/TeFuirnever/azhou-ai-hub/tree/main/skills/">All {{ skills.length }} packages in the repo</a></p>
  </nav>
  <article class="doc-card">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="{{ '/' | url }}">azhou-ai-hub</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">Skills</span>
    </nav>
    <h1>Skills</h1>
    <p class="doc-lede">Every canonical package is independently installable from the repository checkout. This catalog is generated at build time from each package's <code>SKILL.md</code> frontmatter, so it follows the packages as they change; each card links to the package in the repository.</p>
    <p class="count">{{ skills.length }} packages</p>
    <div class="callout note">
      <p>Choose one installation method per skill; see the <a href="https://github.com/TeFuirnever/azhou-ai-hub/blob/main/docs/installation.md">installation guide</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="cardgrid">
      {%- for skill in skills %}
      <li id="{{ skill.name }}">
        <a class="gcard" href="{{ skill.url }}">
          {%- if skill.invocation %}
          <span class="badge">{{ skill.invocation }}</span>
          {%- endif %}
          <span class="gcard-t">{{ skill.name }}</span>
          <span class="gcard-d">{{ skill.description }}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="doc-source">Generated from <code>SKILL.md</code> frontmatter at build time · <a href="https://github.com/TeFuirnever/azhou-ai-hub/blob/main/docs/installation.md">installation guide</a></p>
  </article>
</div>
